ent-ClothingShoesChef = 廚師鞋 | chef shoes
    .desc = 堅固的鞋子，能將墜落物或刀具造成的傷害降至最低。 | Sturdy shoes that minimize injury from falling objects or knives.
ent-ClothingShoesClownBase = { ent-ClothingShoesBaseButcherable }
    .desc = { ent-ClothingShoesBaseButcherable.desc }
ent-ClothingShoesClown = 小丑鞋 | clown shoes
    .desc = 惡作劇者標配的小丑鞋。天啊，這鞋也太大了吧！ | The prankster's standard-issue clowning shoes. Damn they're huge!
ent-ClothingShoesClownBanana = 香蕉小丑鞋 | banana clown shoes
    .desc = 當幽默與鞋履結合，便能將荒謬感提升至全新境界。 | When humor and footwear combine into new levels of absurdity.
ent-ClothingShoesBling = 閃亮小丑鞋 | bling clown shoes
    .desc = 採用精煉的香蕉礦製成，並以新鮮香蕉皮的果肉拋光。這些飾品展現出耀眼奪目的風采。 | Made of refined bananium and shined with the pulp of a fresh banana peel. These make a flashy statement.
